{"id":"n19496-1-11","stage":1,"title":"공 · 球","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n19496-1-11-1","ko":"민준아. 거기 공 좀 이리 던져 줘.","zh":"敏俊啊，把那边的球扔过来给我一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아.","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"거기","meaning":"那儿，那边，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那边，那里。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"1","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}},{"text":"공","meaning":"球","explanation":"공：球。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19496","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里。","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}},{"text":"던져","meaning":"投，掷，扔","explanation":"던지다：投，掷，扔；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"던지다","audio":"/audio/8d394e0764a0b3692cf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66324","senseId":"1","lemma":"던지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"던져","audio":"/audio/731bc9bb1e5c6d0c0129.mp3"}},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"为别人做某事（